<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. on Thursday said it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues slated for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Cave Creek, U.S.D. #93, Ariz., School Improvement bonds, $3.36 million.</p>
<p>--Cave Creek, U.S.D. #93, Ariz., School Improvement bonds, $36.9 million.</p>
<p>--Hampton Bays, U.F.S.D., N.Y., School District bonds, $7.6 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
